# Brewfile — Ubuntu-family desktop extras, merged on top of common/Brewfile.
#
# GUI apps aren't brewable on Linux (casks are macOS-only):
#   - ghostty → PPA or build; see its install docs.
#   - zed     → official installer (zed.dev) or flatpak.
# Their stow configs live in desktop/stow/ regardless; handle the installs
# in a dedicated recipe when fleshing out desktop support.

